  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "invincible while dealing continuous AoE damage",
    "skill1": "arc attack gaining Life Drain",
    "skill2": "Sparks buff shared with allies ignites enemies, reducing their Vitality and dealing DoT",
    "skill3": "battle damage taken reduction",
    "skill4": "ignite enemies to reduce magic damage taken for self and allies",
    "skill5": "strike has no cooldown limit when all enemies are ignited"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Satrana]] goes **invincible during ultimate** while dealing continuous AoE, then arc attacks with **life drain** and Sparks that **ignite enemies for Vitality cuts and DoT** shared with allies. Battle damage reduction helps her stand through the burn setup, ignited foes **lower magic damage taken** for her team, and when all enemies burn her strike **has no cooldown limit**. She peaks once **ignites spread across the line** and her team can exploit the magic mitigation. **Cleanse or short fights** before full ignite leave her cooldown relief inactive.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Satrana]]'s ultimate makes her **invincible** while she burns the field, and **Sparks** let her allies **ignite** your line for Vitality cuts, DoT, and team-wide magic mitigation once burns stick. Do **not** dump burst into Fiery Dance. After invulnerability ends, pressure [[Satrana]] and her Sparks partners with mid-fight [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]] or [[Nerion]], or lasting wide ultimates like [[Shemira]] or [[Frieren]], before every foe is ignited and her arc cooldown drops. **Cut her Life Drain** with [[filter:heal-inhibitor]] like [[Frieren]] or [[Gwyneth]] so she cannot out-sustain through the burn setup."
}
